# #5841, the claim half of the fix removed. Red outside pre-arm too: an idle duplicate
# (one that never wrote, so never claimed) claims after the split.
MODULE: HandOffBoundClaimSkipsLeafStateCheck
TARGET: HandOffBound
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a claim after the split's narrow does not read the leaf state, so an idle stale duplicate claims and writes epoch-only: the eager residual of #5841
PERTURBS: ClaimCheck
BOUNDS: WithStaleDonor = TRUE, MaxWindows = 1

--- FIND
    /\ dst' = IF sNarrowed THEN "stale" ELSE "claimed"
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: the claim does not read the leaf state.
    /\ dst' = "claimed"
--- END
